+
+## AO1: archived order outcome
+
+Seeded Archived orders remain readable but cannot be submitted or cancelled.
+Direct submit returns 409 `{"code":"OrderArchived"}`. Fulfillment returns
+200 `{"status":"Rejected","outcome":"OrderArchived"}` after compensating
+reserved stock, with no reservation. Existing inventory and reservation rejection
+precedence, replay, batch behavior and other lifecycle outcomes are unchanged.
+Cancellation returns 409 OrderNotCancellable. No archive endpoint or migration.
